# Layout

Single crate `gprx`. Not a Cargo workspace. Do not create empty files ahead of the Issue that needs them.

The directory tree lives in `docs/conventions.md`. The public surface lives in `docs/design.md`. Do not copy either into this rule.

`Workspace`, `QueryWorkspace`, `OnlineWorkspace`, and faer types stay crate-private. Combinations that would be ignored or rejected at runtime must not be representable (`.cursor/rules/types.mdc`).
